{"parentUuid":"96a3265f-6a81-4157-b563-e0adc742739f","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ab1c8a4a09fa5a796","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfcEFZMLkgjmGEYkmvmWV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1017,"cache_read_input_tokens":364369,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1017,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfcEFYUFWNtiEfmQmRc9q","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"c19f8611-85de-4316-bf20-ad85bf18eba3","timestamp":"2026-10-01T21:30:12.624Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"c19f8611-85de-4316-bf20-ad85bf18eba3","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ab1c8a4a09fa5a796","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfcEFZMLkgjmGEYkmvmWV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019QDvEXL6sTydqQv2rSrEPd","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Find and download catalog STEP files","subagent_type":"general-purpose","prompt":"Task: find official manufacturer 3D CAD (STEP) files for electrical-panel components and download them, ONLY when the manufacturer (or its official CAD portal) offers a direct download with NO login, NO registration, NO terms/consent acceptance. If a site needs login/registration/terms acceptance, captcha, or only offers it through a gated portal (e.g. CADENAS/TraceParts requiring account), DO NOT download — just list it as skipped with the reason. Download only CAD model files (STEP .stp/.step, or a .zip containing them from the manufacturer domain); never executables. Use WebSearch/WebFetch (load via ToolSearch \"select:WebSearch,WebFetch\") to locate links, and curl (Bash) to download.\n\nTarget folder (write only here): C:\\Users\\Kemal\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-Kemal-Desktop-Kemal-WEBS-TE\\f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8\\scratchpad\\b3\\arastirma\\katalog\\step\nFor each downloaded part save `<lowercase_ordercode>.stp` (extract from zip if needed, keep only the STEP; if zip has variants keep the best matching one and name extras with suffix) and a sidecar `<lowercase_ordercode>.txt` in exactly this style (existing example):\nMANUFACTURER: Phoenix Contact\nORDER NO: 1085256\nTITLE: FL SWITCH 1008N - Industrial Ethernet Switch, 8x RJ45, 24 V DC, DIN rail\nFILE: 1085256.stp (original name ..., STEP AP214, from zip)\nSOURCE: <product page URL> (<how: 3D view and CAD download, no login>)  + the direct file URL\nDIMENSIONS (datasheet): W x H x D mm (width along DIN rail x height x depth from rail) with source URL\nDo not modify any other files. Verify each downloaded file really is STEP (first line \"ISO-10303-21;\").\n\nParts (verify exact order codes from the manufacturer site; correct them if my code is wrong and say so):\n1. Schneider Electric Acti9 iC60N 1P+N C16 — A9F79616 (se.com product page \"CAD\" under documents was direct/no-login for A9R21440 and A9S65440 before; e.g. https://www.se.com/uk/en/product/A9F79616/ ). Also A9F79610 (iC60N 1P+N C10) if the coordinator code is meaningful.\n2. Schneider Acti9 iDPN N 1P+N single module (18 mm) C16 and C6 — find the correct reference numbers (e.g. A9N21559 / A9N21555 or whatever is right for your region) and the STEP.\n3. KUNBUS Revolution Pi RevPi DIO (PR100253) — revolutionpi.com downloads page (\"STEP Files\"); RevPi Connect 4 STEP came earlier from there as a zip.\n4. Phoenix Contact PT 2,5 (3209510) and PT 2,5-PE (3209523) feed-through / PE terminal blocks, and end clamp E/UK (1201442) or the matching end clamp for PT 2,5 (e.g. CLIPFIX 35 3022218) — phoenixcontact.com product pages (FL SWITCH STEP came from there with no login).\n5. Phoenix Contact QUINT4-CAP (supercapacitor DC-UPS 24 V, e.g. QUINT4-CAP/24DC/5/4KJ or /10/8KJ — find order number and pick the 24 V 5 A one) — STEP + datasheet W x H x D.\n6. HARTING Han 10B bulkhead mounted housing (Han B, size 10, single locking lever, e.g. 19 30 010 0301 or similar) + Han-Modular hinged frame 10B — harting.com product pages offer 3D downloads; if gated, skip and list. Also give datasheet dimensions (flange, panel cut-out, height).\nAlso, research only (no download needed): datasheet dimensions W x H x D for each of the above.\n\nFinal answer: a compact table: part | order code (verified) | downloaded file name + size (bytes) | source URL | datasheet dims | status (OK / SKIPPED + reason). Keep it short.","run_in_background":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1017,"cache_read_input_tokens":364369,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1017,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_019QDvEXL6sTydqQv2rSrEPd":{"description":"Find and download catalog STEP files","subagent_type":"general-purpose","prompt":"Task: find official manufacturer 3D CAD (STEP) files for electrical-panel components and download them, ONLY when the manufacturer (or its official CAD portal) offers a direct download with NO login, NO registration, NO terms/consent acceptance. If a site needs login/registration/terms acceptance, captcha, or only offers it through a gated portal (e.g. CADENAS/TraceParts requiring account), DO NOT download — just list it as skipped with the reason. Download only CAD model files (STEP .stp/.step, or a .zip containing them from the manufacturer domain); never executables. Use WebSearch/WebFetch (load via ToolSearch \"select:WebSearch,WebFetch\") to locate links, and curl (Bash) to download.\n\nTarget folder (write only here): C:\\Users\\Kemal\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-Kemal-Desktop-Kemal-WEBS-TE\\f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8\\scratchpad\\b3\\arastirma\\katalog\\step\nFor each downloaded part save `<lowercase_ordercode>.stp` (extract from zip if needed, keep only the STEP; if zip has variants keep the best matching one and name extras with suffix) and a sidecar `<lowercase_ordercode>.txt` in exactly this style (existing example):\nMANUFACTURER: Phoenix Contact\nORDER NO: 1085256\nTITLE: FL SWITCH 1008N - Industrial Ethernet Switch, 8x RJ45, 24 V DC, DIN rail\nFILE: 1085256.stp (original name ..., STEP AP214, from zip)\nSOURCE: <product page URL> (<how: 3D view and CAD download, no login>)  + the direct file URL\nDIMENSIONS (datasheet): W x H x D mm (width along DIN rail x height x depth from rail) with source URL\nDo not modify any other files. Verify each downloaded file really is STEP (first line \"ISO-10303-21;\").\n\nParts (verify exact order codes from the manufacturer site; correct them if my code is wrong and say so):\n1. Schneider Electric Acti9 iC60N 1P+N C16 — A9F79616 (se.com product page \"CAD\" under documents was direct/no-login for A9R21440 and A9S65440 before; e.g. https://www.se.com/uk/en/product/A9F79616/ ). Also A9F79610 (iC60N 1P+N C10) if the coordinator code is meaningful.\n2. Schneider Acti9 iDPN N 1P+N single module (18 mm) C16 and C6 — find the correct reference numbers (e.g. A9N21559 / A9N21555 or whatever is right for your region) and the STEP.\n3. KUNBUS Revolution Pi RevPi DIO (PR100253) — revolutionpi.com downloads page (\"STEP Files\"); RevPi Connect 4 STEP came earlier from there as a zip.\n4. Phoenix Contact PT 2,5 (3209510) and PT 2,5-PE (3209523) feed-through / PE terminal blocks, and end clamp E/UK (1201442) or the matching end clamp for PT 2,5 (e.g. CLIPFIX 35 3022218) — phoenixcontact.com product pages (FL SWITCH STEP came from there with no login).\n5. Phoenix Contact QUINT4-CAP (supercapacitor DC-UPS 24 V, e.g. QUINT4-CAP/24DC/5/4KJ or /10/8KJ — find order number and pick the 24 V 5 A one) — STEP + datasheet W x H x D.\n6. HARTING Han 10B bulkhead mounted housing (Han B, size 10, single locking lever, e.g. 19 30 010 0301 or similar) + Han-Modular hinged frame 10B — harting.com product pages offer 3D downloads; if gated, skip and list. Also give datasheet dimensions (flange, panel cut-out, height).\nAlso, research only (no download needed): datasheet dimensions W x H x D for each of the above.\n\nFinal answer: a compact table: part | order code (verified) | downloaded file name + size (bytes) | source URL | datasheet dims | status (OK / SKIPPED + reason). Keep it short.","run_in_background":true}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfcEFYUFWNtiEfmQmRc9q","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"7c035b0b-7643-4d08-9de7-62f47ab0ab7d","timestamp":"2026-10-01