{"parentUuid":"eac700d8-31de-4070-8a3c-f4c08fff7bbc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"5a7c918e-493a-48a4-bac8-385fce19faf3","agentId":"ab1c8a4a09fa5a796","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QnpH8PRMW991t6ZUjdLxaU","type":"tool_result","content":"EXIT 0\nDENETIM (h3_ust_depo_v1): 17 madde · 0 KALDI · 88 sn\n  RAF: profiller x 4002–4032 / 4398–4428 / 4802–4832 / 5198–5228 · en buyuk aciklik 375 mm · koli yuku 799 Pa → 1,5 mm sac sehimi (basit mesnet) 3.5 mm ≤ 4 · toplam yuk 52 kg (6 × 8.7) → 4 profil GECTI \r\n   BILGI · U_A ust sac en buyuk plak 560 × 856 → oz agirlik sehimi (dort kenar basit) 1.6 mm\r\n   BILGI · U_F ust sac en buyuk plak 670 × 856 → oz agirlik sehimi (dort kenar basit) 2.8 mm\r\n   BILGI · U_KE ust sac en buyuk plak 397 × 856 → oz agirlik sehimi (dort kenar basit) 0.6 mm\r\nDENETIM (h3_ust_depo_v1): 17 madde · 0 KALDI · 88 sn","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"36698066-a600-4f02-a5e8-9da579425487","timestamp":"2026-10-01T22:01:48.682Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"eac700d8-31de-4070-8a3c-f4c08fff7bbc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
